{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1413823-standardizing-node-rule","id":1413823,"title":"Standardizing Node Rule","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-15T13:19:54-07:00","id":1413823,"title":"Standardizing Node Rule","content":"So one thing that bugged me with the node rules was they don\u2019t give you a default on how frequent you get quintessence or dross. It was meant to help, but it would have been infinitely more helpful to have a default with strong encouragement for house ruling it.<br /> <br /> How often do you have quintessence regenerate?<br /> <br /> My basic suggestion is I guess using Freeholds as a baseline.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-15T14:50:58-07:00","id":1413846,"title":"","content":"I don't have a lot of input on what the ideal baseline should be, but something I do:<br /> <br /> &quot;Natural&quot; Nodes have a higher one than Prime created ones. This helps to maintain the setting conceit that mages covet Nodes in the possession of other mages/supernaturals. If a Prime Master can just turn any compatible Sanctum into a Node, it doesn't really make a lot of sense to go chasing after existing ones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-15T15:19:59-07:00","id":1413854,"title":"","content":"Charles Siegel explores several ideas in <i>Sources of Magic</i> and expands on the Book of Chantries system for customizing Nodes.<br /> <br /> As for having a baseline Quintessence, the Node background will offer suggestions. Since Quintessence is needed to make Wonders and is also useful in lowering casting difficulties, it's best to have a range. That way, a 'Quintessence is fairly easily available', 'Quintessence is somewhat available' and 'Quintessence is rare' can all be effective chronicle assumptions. Think of those as the equivalent of low-magic, medium magic, and high-magic settings in Dungeons and Dragons.<br /> <br /> <i>Sources of Magic</i> has several example nodes as well--including merits and flaws that relate to making those Nodes sites for other supernaturals like a Freehold for Changelings.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/285941/Sources-of-Magick\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/images/1/285941.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/285941/Sources-of-Magick\" target=\"_blank\"> Sources of Magick - White Wolf | Storytellers Vault </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/285941/Sources-of-Magick\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/285941/Sources-of-Magick </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Sources of Magick - The Pillars of Creation Where mages get the Quintessence that powers their magicks is as important as what they do with </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}